{"id":"e207373e-4f08-462e-9033-fb58c93142d3","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"39905cc0411dd33c","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/capabilities/decide.ts","baseline":{"blob":"d481251481e042f1915a324faf67357d5232be23","start":7245,"end":8204},"shape":{"type":"FunctionDeclaration","atoms":["async","function","policyDecider","(","request",":","CapabilityRequest",")",":","Promise","<","Verdict","&","{","\"","decided","\"",":","Decided","}",">","{","const","capability","=","capabilityOf","(","request",")",";","const","resource","=","request",".","resource","??","\"","","\"",";","const","pkg","=","askerOf","(","request",")",".","package",";","const","{","trigger","=","\"","you","\"","}","=","request","as","{","\"","trigger","\"","?",":","\"","you","\"","|","\"","edit","\"","}",";","const","effective","=","effectiveDisposition","(","await","loadEffectivePolicy","(",")",",","capability",",","resource",",","isDangerous","(","capability",")",",","{","\"","trigger","\"",":","trigger",",","...","pkg","===","undefined","?","{","}",":","packageNamed","(","pkg",")","}",")",";","if","(","effective","===","\"","allow","\"",")","{","return","{","\"","behavior","\"",":","\"","allow","\"",",","\"","decided","\"",":","\"","policy","\"","}",";","}","if","(","effective","===","\"","deny","\"",")","{","return","{","\"","behavior","\"",":","\"","deny","\"",",","\"","message","\"",":","\"","denied by .silo policy","\"",",","\"","decided","\"",":","\"","policy","\"","}",";","}","if","(","effective","===","\"","skip","\"",")","{","return","{","\"","behavior","\"",":","\"","deny","\"",",","\"","message","\"",":","\"","skipped by .silo policy","\"",",","\"","decided","\"",":","\"","policy","\"","}",";","}","refuseUndecided","(","request",".","scope",",","pkg",")",";","return","{","\"","behavior","\"",":","\"","deny","\"",",","\"","message","\"",":","\"","undecided by .silo policy","\"",",","\"","decided","\"",":","\"","refused","\"","}",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"fa958ac3f6e98a78","after":"65301fe6b467afce"}},"payload":{"text":"The decider: the effective policy — my `policy/<user>.json` overrides layered over the base `policy.json` contract —\nallows or denies with no question (so pre-approved scopes and default-allow patterns like fs:read under the\nworkspace never nag). What it leaves undecided is refused (refuseUndecided). Swappable for an external or AI\ndecider behind this same seam (ARCHITECTURE.md, *Extension points* 5).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:11:13.379Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:11:13.379Z"}
{"id":"fc33b888-1c6b-4339-86a6-ad5d17e5c3fb","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"633b5159dff11d0f","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/capabilities/decide.ts","baseline":{"blob":"9d5fc61064d49f5ea091ee376ee471f9c4d6eaaa","start":0,"end":66},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","AskedWhy","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/editor-api/runtime","\""]},"context":{"after":"597974929dfee6e9"}},"payload":{"text":"ENFORCE — the single capability DECISION ENDPOINT (ext host). A runtime's interceptor (a debug run's package calls,\nthrough runtime-fs.ts) is THIN and round-trips here; no policy or grant store lives in an interceptor. This is the\none place the shared brain runs:\n\nclassify(raw call) → silo scope → broker.gate(redline → grant store → decider) → allow | deny\n\nIt reuses the portable core published in @brianjenkins94/util/silo/enforce: `gate`/`CapabilityDenied`\n(the fixed order), `redline` (BERNARD catastrophic scopes), and the intercept helpers (CAP_FS + scope\nbuilders) as the single classification source. The decider is the policy alone today (what it leaves undecided is\nrefused); an external program or AI can replace it later behind the same seam. All `.silo/` I/O — the base+override\npolicy merge, the observed-capability rollup, the run firehose — lives in editor-api/policy.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:11:49.436Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:11:49.436Z"}
